Output output/units.mp4
Set FontSize 40
Set Width 1920
Set Height 1080
Set Padding 40
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 400ms
Set Shell bash

Hide
Show

Sleep 2s

Type "./calcx"
Enter
Sleep 2500ms


Type "5 meters + 1 meter"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "5 meter / 3 second to kilo meters / hour"
Enter 
Sleep 2s

Type "5 ampere * 20 ohm"
Enter
Sleep 2s
